Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey! (Dumbed down!)\\NHey! Hey! Hey! (Sold out!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:01:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They cut the funding, cut the facts\\NA generation\'s future under attack\\NCritical thinking becomes a crime\\NAs we watch our country\'s steep decline
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Education\'s on the chopping block\\NCorporate overlords with private stock\\NTearing down what we built up\\NAmerica\'s future going bankrupt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! Hey! (Dumbed down!)\\NHey! Hey! Hey! (Sold out!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Democracy crumbles when ignorance reigns\\NA population they can easily contain\\NNo facts, no science, just propaganda flows\\NA calculated plan that nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:02:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Public schools shuttered, privatized gain\\NThe wealthy get choices, the rest feel the pain\\NTech bros and tyrants control what we learn\\NWhile textbooks and truth get thrown in to burn
